Twist TODO List
================

Done in the current tree
------------------------

  [x] GNU package shape (automake gnu, Libtool, gettext, Texinfo)
  [x] Loop, epoll/kqueue, connection, external driver
  [x] Runtime, storage pool, timers, waker
  [x] quickstep TLS and QUIC under Endpoint
  [x] Transfer engine: URL, scheme table, easy/multi/share, DNS, cache, proxy
  [x] HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2, HTTP/3 push parsers
  [x] Redirects, cookies, Basic, Digest, Bearer
  [x] CLI --help, --version, and the HTTP curl options

Still to do
