  [ ] SMTP, IMAP, POP3, MQTT, LDAP
  [ ] DICT, GOPHER, TELNET, RTSP, TFTP, FILE completion against the cache
  [ ] WebSocket (ws/wss) upgrade handler
  [ ] SCP/SFTP, SMB, RTMP
  [ ] DoH resolver
  [ ] kqueue and Windows poll backends on those hosts
  [ ] io_uring backend
  [ ] Full curl option checklist as each scheme lands
